WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
“I changed the directory. Read the terminal and continue here.”

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Ask your existing agent to work in the shared terminal.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Codex checks the draft folder, then waits before writing.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Type in Conn to take control. Change the folder yourself.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Codex reads the terminal again and works in the new folder.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:04.000
The file is in workspace. Nothing was written in draft.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Keep your agent. Share your terminal.
Real Codex CLI + Conn · Human role automated · Waiting shortened
